+        // NOTE: this must stay linear in the size of the header block, since it
+        //       comes from whoever sent the message: a `/[\r\n]+$/` trim
+        //       backtracks quadratically on a long run of bare CR characters,
+        //       and unfolding with `lines.splice()` is quadratic in the number
